<para id="RM000000AW301NX" category="U" type-id="303FJ" name-id="261HY-00" from="200708" to="200912">
<name>ECU Data Monitor/Active Test</name>
<subpara id="RM000000AW301NX_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FSZ00000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<step1>
<ptxt>TaSCAN ECU Data Monitor </ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>For subtle symptoms such as hesitation and rough idle, it is necessary to use a method of collecting data from a vehicle of the same model under the same conditions for comparison, and make an overall judgment from all items of the computer data. </ptxt>
</atten3>
<step2>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), display the [ECU Data Monitor] screen according to the screen display, and check the computer data.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200 </s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
